 "text": "Hello! How's everything today? Start with the heavy stuff at the front. A big bag of flour or rice in the basket gives you extra weight, so the bike feels much more stable. A basket works well, but you'll often need a second bag. A basket is usually about thirty litres, so you'll quickly fill that. Then a pannier on the back is good option. It' much bigger and you can keep it full. They're heavy, and they pull the bike down quite far. For short trips, a basket with two bags is easier.",
